    "map_blocks": "task_bos_dsd_map_0 passes exactly 2 by 2 map blocks. func_080DB978 selects four independent Ursula 4 by 3 block layouts based on state and facing. The arrays contain 4 or 12 native pointers respectively, not opaque byte arrays. Every nonblank target is a complete 32 by 32 u16 tilemap block, and corresponding 2048-byte native payloads compare identical across US, JP and EU. The existing source-owned blank block is reused. Raw tilemap pixels stay assets; all pointer metadata is compiler-owned."
